{"seq":2,"slug":"hammerspoon-keyboard-maestro","title":"Hammerspoon 与 Keyboard Maestro","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/system-level-automation/hammerspoon-keyboard-maestro","wordCount":834,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"hammerspoon-与-keyboard-maestro\">Hammerspoon 与 Keyboard Maestro</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>在 macOS 系统级自动化的领域，Hammerspoon 和 Keyboard Maestro 代表了两种截然不同的哲学。Hammerspoon 是一个开源的 Lua 脚本桥接引擎，将 macOS 的几乎所有系统 API 暴露给 Lua 脚本——它给了你一块空白画布和一套完整的颜料。Keyboard Maestro 则是一个商业化的可视化宏引擎，通过图形界面组合上百种预制动作——它像一个功能丰富的乐高套装。</p>\n<p>两者都能实现窗口管理、应用控制、文本处理、系统事件响应等自动化，但路径截然不同。本文将对比两种范式的适用场景，并提供各自的实战配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"hammerspoon-架构\">Hammerspoon 架构</h3><p>Hammerspoon 的本质是一个 Lua 解释器 + macOS Accessibility/系统 API 绑定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"┌───────────────────────────────┐&#10;│     你的 Lua 脚本 (init.lua)   │&#10;├───────────────────────────────┤&#10;│     Hammerspoon 核心引擎       │&#10;│  ├── hs.window    窗口管理     │&#10;│  ├── hs.hotkey    热键绑定     │&#10;│  ├── hs.application 应用控制   │&#10;│  ├── hs.eventtap  事件拦截     │&#10;│  ├── hs.timer     定时任务     │&#10;│  ├── hs.wifi      网络事件     │&#10;│  ├── hs.usb       USB 设备     │&#10;│  ├── hs.caffeinate 电源管理    │&#10;│  └── hs.ipc       进程间通信   │&#10;├───────────────────────────────┤&#10;│     macOS System APIs          │&#10;└───────────────────────────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>┌───────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│     你的 Lua 脚本 (init.lua)   │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├───────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│     Hammerspoon 核心引擎       │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  ├── hs.window    窗口管理     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  ├── hs.hotkey    热键绑定     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  ├── hs.application 应用控制   │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  ├── hs.eventtap  事件拦截     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  ├── hs.timer     定时任务     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  ├── hs.wifi      网络事件     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  ├── hs.usb       USB 设备     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  ├── hs.caffeinate 电源管理    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  └── hs.ipc       进程间通信   │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├───────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│     macOS System APIs          │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└───────────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"keyboard-maestro-架构\">Keyboard Maestro 架构</h3><p>Keyboard Maestro 的核心是宏（Macro）系统：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Macro Group (作用域: 全局/特定应用)&#10;└── Macro (一个自动化单元)&#10;    ├── Trigger (触发方式)&#10;    │   ├── Hot Key&#10;    │   ├── Typed String&#10;    │   ├── Application Trigger&#10;    │   ├── USB Device Trigger&#10;    │   └── Cron Trigger&#10;    └── Actions (执行序列)&#10;        ├── Move Window&#10;        ├── Type Text&#10;        ├── Execute Shell Script&#10;        ├── Set Variable&#10;        ├── If/Then/Else&#10;        └── Repeat\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Macro Group (作用域: 全局/特定应用)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Macro (一个自动化单元)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── Trigger (触发方式)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── Hot Key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── Typed String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── Application Trigger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── USB Device Trigger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── Cron Trigger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── Actions (执行序列)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── Move Window</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── Type Text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── Execute Shell Script</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── Set Variable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── If/Then/Else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── Repeat</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"选型决策矩阵\">选型决策矩阵</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Hammerspoon</th>\n<th>Keyboard Maestro</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编程模型</td>\n<td>纯代码（Lua）</td>\n<td>可视化 + 可嵌代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>需要编程能力</td>\n<td>低，拖拽即用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>无限（Lua 能做的都行）</td>\n<td>受限于预制动作集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本控制</td>\n<td>天然友好（文本文件）</td>\n<td>困难（二进制格式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试体验</td>\n<td>Console 实时反馈</td>\n<td>内置动作日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格</td>\n<td>免费开源</td>\n<td>一次性购买 $36</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 操作</td>\n<td>需手动编写坐标/Accessibility</td>\n<td>录制 + 图像识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区</td>\n<td>GitHub + Lua 脚本分享</td>\n<td>官方论坛 + 宏分享</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"hammerspoon-窗口管理系统\">Hammerspoon 窗口管理系统</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- ~/.hammerspoon/init.lua&#10;&#10;-- 窗口管理模块&#10;local function moveWindow(position)&#10;  local win = hs.window.focusedWindow()&#10;  if not win then return end&#10;  local screen = win:screen():frame()&#10;  local f = win:frame()&#10;&#10;  if position == &quot;left&quot; then&#10;    f.x = screen.x&#10;    f.y = screen.y&#10;    f.w = screen.w / 2&#10;    f.h = screen.h&#10;  elseif position == &quot;right&quot; then&#10;    f.x = screen.x + screen.w / 2&#10;    f.y = screen.y&#10;    f.w = screen.w / 2&#10;    f.h = screen.h&#10;  elseif position == &quot;top&quot; then&#10;    f.x = screen.x&#10;    f.y = screen.y&#10;    f.w = screen.w&#10;    f.h = screen.h / 2&#10;  elseif position == &quot;bottom&quot; then&#10;    f.x = screen.x&#10;    f.y = screen.y + screen.h / 2&#10;    f.w = screen.w&#10;    f.h = screen.h / 2&#10;  elseif position == &quot;maximize&quot; then&#10;    f = screen&#10;  elseif position == &quot;center&quot; then&#10;    f.w = screen.w * 0.7&#10;    f.h = screen.h * 0.8&#10;    f.x = screen.x + (screen.w - f.w) / 2&#10;    f.y = screen.y + (screen.h - f.h) / 2&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  win:setFrame(f)&#10;end&#10;&#10;-- Hyper Key 绑定（⌃⌥⌘⇧）&#10;local hyper = {&quot;ctrl&quot;, &quot;alt&quot;, &quot;cmd&quot;, &quot;shift&quot;}&#10;&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;h&quot;, function() moveWindow(&quot;left&quot;) end)&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;l&quot;, function() moveWindow(&quot;right&quot;) end)&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;k&quot;, function() moveWindow(&quot;top&quot;) end)&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;j&quot;, function() moveWindow(&quot;bottom&quot;) end)&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;m&quot;, function() moveWindow(&quot;maximize&quot;) end)&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;c&quot;, function() moveWindow(&quot;center&quot;) end)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- ~/.hammerspoon/init.lua</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 窗口管理模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local function moveWindow(position)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local win = hs.window.focusedWindow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if not win then return end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local screen = win:screen():frame()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local f = win:frame()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if position == \"left\" then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.x = screen.x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.y = screen.y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.w = screen.w / 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.h = screen.h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  elseif position == \"right\" then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.x = screen.x + screen.w / 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.y = screen.y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.w = screen.w / 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.h = screen.h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  elseif position == \"top\" then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.x = screen.x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.y = screen.y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.w = screen.w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.h = screen.h / 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  elseif position == \"bottom\" then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.x = screen.x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.y = screen.y + screen.h / 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.w = screen.w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.h = screen.h / 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  elseif position == \"maximize\" then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f = screen</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  elseif position == \"center\" then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.w = screen.w * 0.7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.h = screen.h * 0.8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.x = screen.x + (screen.w - f.w) / 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f.y = screen.y + (screen.h - f.h) / 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  win:setFrame(f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Hyper Key 绑定（⌃⌥⌘⇧）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local hyper = {\"ctrl\", \"alt\", \"cmd\", \"shift\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"h\", function() moveWindow(\"left\") end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"l\", function() moveWindow(\"right\") end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"k\", function() moveWindow(\"top\") end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"j\", function() moveWindow(\"bottom\") end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"m\", function() moveWindow(\"maximize\") end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"c\", function() moveWindow(\"center\") end)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"hammerspoon-应用级自动化\">Hammerspoon 应用级自动化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- Wi-Fi 事件响应&#10;local wifiWatcher = hs.wifi.watcher.new(function()&#10;  local network = hs.wifi.currentNetwork()&#10;  if network == &quot;HomeNetwork&quot; then&#10;    hs.notify.show(&quot;Home Mode&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;Switched to home configuration&quot;)&#10;    -- 自动连接家庭 NAS&#10;    os.execute(&quot;open smb://nas.local/shared&quot;)&#10;  elseif network == &quot;OfficeNetwork&quot; then&#10;    hs.notify.show(&quot;Work Mode&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;Switched to work configuration&quot;)&#10;    -- 启动工作应用&#10;    hs.application.launchOrFocus(&quot;Slack&quot;)&#10;    hs.application.launchOrFocus(&quot;Arc&quot;)&#10;  end&#10;end)&#10;wifiWatcher:start()&#10;&#10;-- USB 设备事件&#10;local usbWatcher = hs.usb.watcher.new(function(data)&#10;  if data.eventType == &quot;added&quot; and data.productName == &quot;YubiKey&quot; then&#10;    hs.notify.show(&quot;YubiKey&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;Security key connected&quot;)&#10;  end&#10;end)&#10;usbWatcher:start()&#10;&#10;-- 应用切换时自动调整输入法&#10;local appInputMethod = {&#10;  [&quot;Code&quot;] = &quot;com.apple.inputmethod.SCIM.ITABC&quot;,&#10;  [&quot;Terminal&quot;] = &quot;com.apple.keylayout.ABC&quot;,&#10;  [&quot;Slack&quot;] = &quot;com.apple.inputmethod.SCIM.ITABC&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;local appWatcher = hs.application.watcher.new(function(name, event, app)&#10;  if event == hs.application.watcher.activated then&#10;    local targetIM = appInputMethod[name]&#10;    if targetIM then&#10;      hs.keycodes.currentSourceID(targetIM)&#10;    end&#10;  end&#10;end)&#10;appWatcher:start()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Wi-Fi 事件响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local wifiWatcher = hs.wifi.watcher.new(function()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local network = hs.wifi.currentNetwork()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if network == \"HomeNetwork\" then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hs.notify.show(\"Home Mode\", \"\", \"Switched to home configuration\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- 自动连接家庭 NAS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    os.execute(\"open smb://nas.local/shared\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  elseif network == \"OfficeNetwork\" then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hs.notify.show(\"Work Mode\", \"\", \"Switched to work configuration\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- 启动工作应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hs.application.launchOrFocus(\"Slack\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hs.application.launchOrFocus(\"Arc\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wifiWatcher:start()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- USB 设备事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local usbWatcher = hs.usb.watcher.new(function(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if data.eventType == \"added\" and data.productName == \"YubiKey\" then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hs.notify.show(\"YubiKey\", \"\", \"Security key connected\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>usbWatcher:start()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 应用切换时自动调整输入法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local appInputMethod = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"Code\"] = \"com.apple.inputmethod.SCIM.ITABC\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"Terminal\"] = \"com.apple.keylayout.ABC\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"Slack\"] = \"com.apple.inputmethod.SCIM.ITABC\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local appWatcher = hs.application.watcher.new(function(name, event, app)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if event == hs.application.watcher.activated then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local targetIM = appInputMethod[name]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if targetIM then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      hs.keycodes.currentSourceID(targetIM)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>appWatcher:start()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"keyboard-maestro-实战配置\">Keyboard Maestro 实战配置</h3><h4 id=\"宏-1-智能文本处理管道\">宏 1：智能文本处理管道</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Trigger: Hot Key ⌃⌥T&#10;Actions:&#10;1. Set Variable &quot;selectedText&quot; to System Clipboard&#10;2. Execute Shell Script:&#10;   echo &quot;$KMVAR_selectedText&quot; | sed &#39;s/  */ /g&#39; | tr -d &#39;\\n&#39;&#10;3. Set System Clipboard to %ExecuteResult%&#10;4. Display Text: &quot;Cleaned: %ExecuteResult%&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Trigger: Hot Key ⌃⌥T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Actions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. Set Variable \"selectedText\" to System Clipboard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. Execute Shell Script:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   echo \"$KMVAR_selectedText\" | sed 's/  */ /g' | tr -d '\\n'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. Set System Clipboard to %ExecuteResult%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. Display Text: \"Cleaned: %ExecuteResult%\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"宏-2-项目上下文切换\">宏 2：项目上下文切换</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Trigger: Typed String &quot;;proj&quot;&#10;Actions:&#10;1. Prompt for User Input (dropdown: Project A/B/C)&#10;2. If variable &quot;projectChoice&quot; = &quot;Project A&quot;&#10;   a. Activate &quot;Arc&quot; → Open URL &quot;project-a.notion.site&quot;&#10;   b. Activate &quot;VS Code&quot; → Menu &quot;File &gt; Open Recent &gt; ~/projects/project-a&quot;&#10;   c. Activate &quot;Terminal&quot; → Type &quot;cd ~/projects/project-a &amp;&amp; clear&quot;&#10;3. Set Variable &quot;currentProject&quot; to &quot;Project A&quot;&#10;4. Display Notification: &quot;Switched to Project A&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Trigger: Typed String \";proj\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Actions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. Prompt for User Input (dropdown: Project A/B/C)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. If variable \"projectChoice\" = \"Project A\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   a. Activate \"Arc\" → Open URL \"project-a.notion.site\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   b. Activate \"VS Code\" → Menu \"File > Open Recent > ~/projects/project-a\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   c. Activate \"Terminal\" → Type \"cd ~/projects/project-a &#x26;&#x26; clear\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. Set Variable \"currentProject\" to \"Project A\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. Display Notification: \"Switched to Project A\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"宏-3-基于图像识别的-ui-自动化\">宏 3：基于图像识别的 UI 自动化</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Trigger: Hot Key ⌃⌥R&#10;Actions:&#10;1. If Image Found &quot;approve-button.png&quot; on screen&#10;   a. Click Found Image&#10;   b. Pause 1 second&#10;   c. If Image Found &quot;confirm-dialog.png&quot;&#10;      → Click Found Image&#10;2. Else&#10;   a. Display Alert &quot;Approve button not found&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Trigger: Hot Key ⌃⌥R</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Actions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. If Image Found \"approve-button.png\" on screen</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   a. Click Found Image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   b. Pause 1 second</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   c. If Image Found \"confirm-dialog.png\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      → Click Found Image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. Else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   a. Display Alert \"Approve button not found\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"hammerspoon-模块化组织\">Hammerspoon 模块化组织</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- ~/.hammerspoon/init.lua (入口文件，保持精简)&#10;require(&quot;modules.window&quot;)      -- 窗口管理&#10;require(&quot;modules.hotkeys&quot;)     -- 全局热键&#10;require(&quot;modules.watchers&quot;)    -- 系统事件监听&#10;require(&quot;modules.caffeine&quot;)    -- 防休眠控制&#10;require(&quot;modules.clipboard&quot;)   -- 剪贴板增强&#10;&#10;-- 自动重载配置&#10;hs.loadSpoon(&quot;ReloadConfiguration&quot;)&#10;spoon.ReloadConfiguration:start()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- ~/.hammerspoon/init.lua (入口文件，保持精简)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>require(\"modules.window\")      -- 窗口管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>require(\"modules.hotkeys\")     -- 全局热键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>require(\"modules.watchers\")    -- 系统事件监听</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>require(\"modules.caffeine\")    -- 防休眠控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>require(\"modules.clipboard\")   -- 剪贴板增强</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 自动重载配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.loadSpoon(\"ReloadConfiguration\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>spoon.ReloadConfiguration:start()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"keyboard-maestro-组织原则\">Keyboard Maestro 组织原则</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>Macro Groups 按应用分类</strong>：每个应用一个 Group，设置&quot;仅在该应用活跃时启用&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>全局 Group 保持精简</strong>：只放真正跨应用的操作</li>\n<li><strong>变量命名规范</strong>：<code>Local_xxx</code> 表示宏内变量，<code>Global_xxx</code> 表示跨宏共享</li>\n<li><strong>禁用而非删除</strong>：暂时不用的宏 Disable 而非删除，便于恢复</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"混合使用策略\">混合使用策略</h3><p>很多高手同时使用两者，各取所长：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Hammerspoon</strong>：窗口管理、系统事件响应、网络/USB 监听</li>\n<li><strong>Keyboard Maestro</strong>：UI 自动化（图像识别）、Typed String 触发、复杂宏录制</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者混合使用时的事件流转如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    E[&quot;系统事件 / 热键&quot;] --&gt; A{处理层}&#10;    A --&gt;|系统事件| H[&quot;Hammerspoon:Wi-Fi / USB / 窗口&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|UI 操作 / Typed String| K[&quot;Keyboard Maestro:图像识别 / 宏&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt;|&quot;hs.osascript 调用&quot;| K&#10;    H --&gt; R[完成自动化任务]&#10;    K --&gt; R\">graph TD\n    E[\"系统事件 / 热键\"] --&gt; A{处理层}\n    A --&gt;|系统事件| H[\"Hammerspoon:Wi-Fi / USB / 窗口\"]\n    A --&gt;|UI 操作 / Typed String| K[\"Keyboard Maestro:图像识别 / 宏\"]\n    H --&gt;|\"hs.osascript 调用\"| K\n    H --&gt; R[完成自动化任务]\n    K --&gt; R</pre><p>它们可以互相调用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- Hammerspoon 调用 Keyboard Maestro 宏&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;x&quot;, function()&#10;  hs.osascript.applescript([[&#10;    tell application &quot;Keyboard Maestro Engine&quot;&#10;      do script &quot;My Complex Macro&quot;&#10;    end tell&#10;  ]])&#10;end)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Hammerspoon 调用 Keyboard Maestro 宏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"x\", function()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  hs.osascript.applescript([[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tell application \"Keyboard Maestro Engine\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      do script \"My Complex Macro\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end tell</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ]])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"hammerspoon-生态\">Hammerspoon 生态</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Spoons</td>\n<td>可复用的模块包（官方仓库 100+）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hs.ipc</td>\n<td>CLI 工具，从终端触发 Hammerspoon 函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Console</td>\n<td>内置 REPL，实时测试 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 文档</td>\n<td>hammerspoon.org/docs/</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"keyboard-maestro-生态\">Keyboard Maestro 生态</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Macro Library</td>\n<td>官方宏库（按类别分类）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Forum</td>\n<td>活跃社区，宏分享和问答</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wiki</td>\n<td>详细文档和教程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web Trigger</td>\n<td>HTTP 触发宏执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>Hammerspoon 和 Keyboard Maestro 是 macOS 系统级自动化的两大支柱。选择取决于你的技术偏好和场景需求：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>纯代码控制、版本管理友好</strong> → Hammerspoon</li>\n<li><strong>快速构建、UI 交互自动化</strong> → Keyboard Maestro</li>\n<li><strong>最强组合</strong>：Hammerspoon 处理系统事件 + Keyboard Maestro 处理 UI 操作</li>\n<li>Hammerspoon 的 Wi-Fi/USB/电源事件监听是独家能力</li>\n<li>Keyboard Maestro 的图像识别是自动化&quot;最后手段&quot;——当没有 API 可用时</li>\n<li>两者的配置都应纳入备份体系（Hammerspoon 天然 Git 友好）</li>\n</ol>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Hammerspoon 与 Keyboard Maestro","id":"hammerspoon-与-keyboard-maestro"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"Hammerspoon 架构","id":"hammerspoon-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"Keyboard Maestro 架构","id":"keyboard-maestro-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"选型决策矩阵","id":"选型决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"Hammerspoon 窗口管理系统","id":"hammerspoon-窗口管理系统"},{"level":3,"text":"Hammerspoon 应用级自动化","id":"hammerspoon-应用级自动化"},{"level":3,"text":"Keyboard Maestro 实战配置","id":"keyboard-maestro-实战配置"},{"level":4,"text":"宏 1：智能文本处理管道","id":"宏-1-智能文本处理管道"},{"level":4,"text":"宏 2：项目上下文切换","id":"宏-2-项目上下文切换"},{"level":4,"text":"宏 3：基于图像识别的 UI 自动化","id":"宏-3-基于图像识别的-ui-自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"Hammerspoon 模块化组织","id":"hammerspoon-模块化组织"},{"level":3,"text":"Keyboard Maestro 组织原则","id":"keyboard-maestro-组织原则"},{"level":3,"text":"混合使用策略","id":"混合使用策略"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"Hammerspoon 生态","id":"hammerspoon-生态"},{"level":3,"text":"Keyboard Maestro 生态","id":"keyboard-maestro-生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"Apple Shortcuts 高级用法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/system-level-automation/apple-shortcuts-advanced"},"next":{"title":"文件系统自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/system-level-automation/filesystem-automation"}}